Package: miso
Type: Package
Title: Multivariate Inference, Similarity and Ordination (MISO)
Version: 1.0.0
Author: Januar Harianto
Maintainer: Januar Harianto <januar.harianto@sydney.edu.au>
Description: Provides PERMANOVA, PERMDISP, ANOSIM, SIMPER, nMDS, PCoA, and cluster
    analysis workflows for multivariate abundance and community-style data.
    The module uses a shared transformation and dissimilarity workflow powered
    by the vegan R package.
License: GPL (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: jmvcore (>= 0.8.5), R6, vegan, permute, ggplot2
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    yaml
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
